<description>&lt;p&gt;Venancio Mondlane continues his terrorism trial over the 2024 election protests, while Islamist militants persist in attacking civilians in Cabo Delgado, complicating humanitarian access. MSF reports that barriers to care in Macomia hinder aid delivery to affected populations. The insurgency, driven by Ansar al-Sunna, remains focused on civilian targets. The trial and the access constraints illustrate simultaneous political and security pressures in Mozambique. 151 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE1UcHlIOGNqeFRSQkNQRDEyaHRVWkdiLVpXakszQ3dwQnNseS0xRmxma09IRHlLbjBKN2JOeWtFdmVKNzlPSGR4VEFJSWFiQU9USEdVT0IxSmxTYjg?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTFBETnZtZlZtUmM1dTI2dnZOTkpFZkp1NTlqTGpIOEloODZSQlFDckJaY3R0Y0lxOTJpZVNwVmxFY3dCTWl4YXpzcGhOaTdnUHdmTTZRRjAyNElLa05r?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxNdzFZS0FiVlptY3lqLVZIZEhCOGNZekdZYzJXd2dST09tNlcxaEU0Q3EwUTNrclZqVnQ4Ty1UVENhUEw3QmktWlJacDY3VlNkQVBKZDFNRG9jUlVuVmsyY3ljUXVZd2xrSDdSR05RR2diOFFHbFZTOWw3RjBFTXZhMXVERDc5ZnAySlpBb0JnWXpVV0Q2OGU3WkVMUENjN1g1eUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Club of Mozambique&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxQckZNbS1pZzY5dG5oU1hQOXNiV08yUW44UE9YN1pzWjNPaDlYRTVuaElyUmY0VVRsSnN1dXFTVGJ1LVotS3RfVmFDOXJOWUZ5SjVWZUs5bF9YNVJ4VHFhM0llWHpDQ3FRalBwMXhBR0FtNDdDMGdfNThBbmliRzlvemZFTmJsTHBrR1ExWllYb1BXbEZ5OUJDUw?oc=5&quot;&gt;AfricaSoccer.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxQYUhYcmVYOXpVUVE2MWJhY3pkNDEyUkVQM0ItUWNaT2NuelliTi1aMUZqOVN1RnR1M1c5MUlXNDJJNWZkTnNsNnQxSERBRHRGc0ZOdWNmVmVXZURs